ok   HGBR poisson (l2=0.5): baseline = log(mean y); g = exp(f) - y, h = exp(f); predict = exp(baseline + leaf)  (max rel diff 1.81e-08; library leaf values [-0.376164, 0.645367], hand [-0.376164, 0.645367]; sizes [19, 11])
ok   HGBR gamma (1.3+, l2=0.5): baseline = log(mean y); g = 1 - y exp(-f), h = y exp(-f); predict = exp(baseline + leaf)
